Z||000002||turbo86se||11-17-2001||11:58 AM||||Can't wait! I went outside several times last night and didn't see anything. Tonight promises to be the best. Good thing is I have to intern tonight! So I'll be out to 4-5am causing trouble and writing tickets! It will be cool to pull someone over in the middle of a meteor shower!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Notice: When I get hired I promise NEVER to pull over a Fiero owner except to check out the Fiero!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SC.jpg"> ||||reg||1
